                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
              </svg>
              Chat Guidelines
            </h3>
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm">
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-semibold text-[#111518] mb-2">✅ Best Practices:</h4>
                <ul class="space-y-1 text-gray-700">
                  <li>• Be clear and specific in your messages</li>
                  <li>• Respect leaders' time and availability</li>
                  <li>• Use professional and respectful language</li>
                  <li>• Check their online status before messaging</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-semibold text-[#111518] mb-2">💡 Response Times:</h4>
                <ul class="space-y-1 text-gray-700">
